---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 | 2027 机场日志"
  description="您所请求的页面不存在或已被移除。请返回首页浏览 17 家机场档案全文。"
  canonicalPath="/404"
>
  <div class="error-page-container">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <div class="error-badge">404 NOT FOUND</div>
      <h1 class="error-title">抱歉，您访问的页面不存在</h1>
      <p class="error-desc">
        本站所有机场档案均直接呈现在首页，采用页内锚点进行定位导航。您所点击的链接可能已失效或已被调整。
      </p>
      <div class="error-actions">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-hero-lg">
          返回机场日志首页
        </a>
        <a href="/airport-alerts/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-hero-lg">
          查看风险预警专区
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .error-page-container {
    padding: 100px 0 120px 0;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .error-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    background: #FEE2E2;
    color: #DC2626;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .error-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-title);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .error-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .error-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
